Post-6.18 fixes in this tree that the reused files carry:
  51e39ceeca7e  Improve firmware power off for layout_mars config
                (pvr_fw_startstop.c: MARS_IDLE instead of the Sidekick/SLC
                polls; this core has LAYOUT_MARS)
  62a6f98cda4e  Skip 2nd thread DM association for non META Firmware
                (pvr_fw_startstop.c)
and, in pvr_mmu.c and pvr_queue.c (reused since M3) and pvr_power.c (not
reused):
  0a8224058a58  Fix page count for page table for map() interface
  7b824c293a6b  Propagate map failures correctly from pvr_mmu_map_sgl()
  a55c2a5c8d68  Fix deadlock in soft reset sequence

